										"Text":
										{
											"$text": "# UICS TERMINAL SYSTEM – README\r\n\r\nWelcome to the Iron Guard Corps Command Terminal.\r\n\r\nThis terminal is a hardened access point of the IGC BlackGrid, governed under Directive IRON-LAW/7.\r\nIt is intended exclusively for Iron Guard personnel operating under verified clearance.\r\n\r\nAll activity is continuously monitored, cross-checked, and retained.\r\nThere is no anonymity inside Iron Guard systems.\r\n\r\n## SYSTEM FUNCTIONS\r\n\r\n- **read** – Open and view a file's contents  \r\n- **run** – Execute a script or terminal-compatible file  \r\n- **scan** – Check a file for security classification or hidden data  \r\n- **download** – Save a file from the terminal to your local device  \r\n\r\nNeed more info? Use the `help` command at any time for detailed usage.\r\n## USER LEVELS\r\n\r\n- Guest: View-only access to non-sensitive bulletins and maintenance schedules\r\n- Meteorologist: Exclusive access to weather data.\r\n- Admin: Full terminal control, including configuration management and override protocols\r\n\r\n## CODE OF CONDUCT\r\n\r\n- Verify clearance before executing any command.Credentials are non-transferable. \r\n- Shared access is treated as sabotage.\r\n- Report inconsistencies, foreign data artifacts, or unexpected system responses immediately.\r\n- In the event of suspected compromise, initiate BLACKOUT PROTOCOL OMEGA and sever all external links.\r\n\r\nFailure to comply will be logged and escalated without warning.\r\n\r\n## SUPPORT CONTACT\r\n\r\nTechnical escalation is handled internally by IGC Systems Oversight.\r\nNo external support channels exist.\r\n\r\n## FINAL NOTICE\r\n\r\nThis terminal is property of the Iron Guard Corps.\r\nUnauthorized access, data extraction, or misuse constitutes treason under Iron Guard military law.\r\n\r\nPunishment includes:\r\n\r\n- Detention\r\n- Reassignment\r\n- Permanent clearance revocation\r\n\r\nThe Iron Guard does not forgive negligence.\r\n\r\nIGC — Discipline. Authority. Dominion.\r\n\r\n> END OF FILE",
											"$ns": "[4442EDC16ABAC1CFA5A5B695986A3659]",
											"$key": "5563C4E9468B68CD786425B79C01646C"
										}
									}
								]
							}
						}
