										"Text":
										{
											"$text": "Document Title: \"IGC_Operations.zip\"  \r\nDate: 2024-11-28  \r\nClassification: Confidential – Internal Distribution Only\r\n\r\nDocument successfully scanned and archived.  \r\nPreview of Document Content:\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\"FACILITY OVERVIEW – SITE BLOCK-7:  \r\nThe factory installation adjacent to the quarry remains fully operational and is responsible for high-volume processing of marble and composite concrete. The materials produced are used in structural reinforcement, subterranean encasement, and modular defensive installations.\r\n\r\nKey operations include rotary crushing, thermal curing, and form compression. Automated batching units maintain a 24/7 output cycle. All export shipments are routed through controlled rail access under GridSec Protocol 6C.\r\n\r\nPersonnel clearance checks are enforced at two entry gates. Observation drones perform perimeter sweeps at 20-minute intervals. While the site is not classified as a high-risk zone, patrols have been increased following recent interference reports from nearby sectors.\r\n\r\nFacility status: STABLE  \r\nOutput capacity: 91%  \r\nSecurity recommendation: Maintain current protocols. Escalation unnecessary unless actionable intel is confirmed.\"\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nFull document secured for reference and compliance logging.",
